{"version":1,"key":"card:297","content":{"id":297,"content":[{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"Promise.all","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"63ec05e6-a374-431e-bfbc-cc4ebab440de","contentId":284,"contentTitle":"","contentType":"card","refId":296,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","type":"content-link"},{"text":" 可以等待多个异步任务执行完成，其返回一个 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"Promise","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，只有这些异步任务全部执行成功时，返回的 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"Promise","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 才是 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"resolved","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的，否则一旦一个 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"rejected","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，其结果就是 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"rejected","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的，但是有的时候只要求同时执行，但是不要求每个都必须成功，这个时候就可以使用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"Promise.allSettled","type":"formatted"},{"text":".","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b39e7170-dfc1-43dc-8aa2-13a05d394263","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"Promise.allSettled","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 接收的参数同样是 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"Promise","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 数组，同样返回一个 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"Promise","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，当所有的 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"Promise settle","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 时（成功或者失败），","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"Promise","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 变为 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"resolved","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，其结果是一个数组，数组中的每个值就是每个 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"Promise","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的执行结果，是一个对象，有一个 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"status","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 属性表示执行结果是成功还是失败，有两种取值","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c9075056-2605-4794-a0e8-72992fef8825","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"fullfilled","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，执行成功，其结果可以从对象的 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"value","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 中取得","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"188198b3-85bc-401a-bacb-67d6d2846f8b","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"4a67350e-b28c-4d1f-bfb7-bf1f7c584cad","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"rejected","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，执行失败，失败原因可以从 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"reason","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 中取得","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"704f4bf8-2875-4a1e-8e2f-ad912a953612","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"b8618e35-8930-4ac1-902a-404e40a633f3","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"0ae5d75d-84dc-4346-aa78-0c2a7d82b5e3","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const promise1 = new Promise(resolve => {\n  setTimeout(() => {\n    resolve(1)\n  }, 1000)\n})\n\nconst promise2 = new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\n  setTimeout(() => {\n    reject(\"timeout\")\n  }, 500)\n})\n\nPromise.allSettled([promise1, promise2]).then((results) => {\n  console.log(results); // [\n                        //    { status: 'fulfilled', value: 1 },\n                        //    { status: 'rejected', reason: 'timeout' }\n                        // ]\n});","collabId":"86349326-948a-4e29-a7a4-657e181566c2","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994